  "details": "As we approach the 10-year mark since VRChat introduced its account system (around 2015), I would love to suggest a 10-Year Anniversary Badge to recognize and celebrate the dedication of long-time users who have been part of the community for a decade.\n\nThis badge could be automatically granted to accounts that have reached 10 years of total playtime since account creation. It would be a heartfelt thank-you to all the loyal supporters who have stayed with VRChat throughout the years — and it should be available to all eligible users without requiring VRChat Plus membership.",
